  "body": "<p>Every payment request starts by choosing who to charge. Scoryboard offers three lists to choose them from.</p>\n\n<h2>Before you start</h2>\n\n<p>You need a payout account. See <a href=\"https://help.scoryboard.com/en/articles/16775810-setting-up-your-payout-account\">Setting up your payout account</a>.</p>\n\n<p>On a team, a leaderboard or a match, only the <strong>Owner</strong> can ask for money. An <strong>Administrator</strong> and a <strong>Player</strong> see the <strong>PAYMENT</strong> tab, but only its <strong>Pay</strong> half.</p>\n\n<h2>Choosing a source</h2>\n\n<ol>\n  <li>Open <strong>Payment</strong> and choose <strong>Request Payment</strong>.\n    <p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/MaabSaleeem/scoryboard@6fde7f174a61b4d44e71d2fa26e77db8689028ff/screenshots/17/17.3/01-request-payment-button.c75d185f.png\" alt=\"The Payment page with the Request Payment button outlined.\"></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>Pick where your players come from.\n    <p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/MaabSaleeem/scoryboard@6fde7f174a61b4d44e71d2fa26e77db8689028ff/screenshots/17/17.3/02-source-chooser.c13f9cc0.png\" alt=\"The Request Payment window offering Leaderboards, Teams and Friends.\"></p>\n  </li>\n  <li><strong>Teams</strong> lists the teams you own.\n    <p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/MaabSaleeem/scoryboard@6fde7f174a61b4d44e71d2fa26e77db8689028ff/screenshots/17/17.3/03-select-team.2982a315.png\" alt=\"The Select Team window reading &quot;Your Teams (2)&quot;, with KB 17 United outlined.\"></p>\n  </li>\n  <li><strong>Leaderboards</strong> lists the leaderboards you own.\n    <p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/MaabSaleeem/scoryboard@6fde7f174a61b4d44e71d2fa26e77db8689028ff/screenshots/17/17.3/04-select-leaderboard.cafd38fe.png\" alt=\"The Select Leaderboard window reading &quot;Your Leaderboards (1)&quot;.\"></p>\n  </li>\n  <li><strong>Friends</strong> lists everybody on your friends list.\n    <p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/MaabSaleeem/scoryboard@6fde7f174a61b4d44e71d2fa26e77db8689028ff/screenshots/17/17.3/05-select-friends.898ff582.png\" alt=\"The Select Friends window listing nine friends.\"></p>\n  </li>\n</ol>\n\n<h2>Starting from a team, a leaderboard or a match</h2>\n\n<ol>\n  <li>Open the team and choose its <strong>PAYMENT</strong> tab. As the Owner you get <strong>Requests</strong>, <strong>Pay</strong> and a <strong>Request Payment</strong> button.\n    <p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/MaabSaleeem/scoryboard@6fde7f174a61b4d44e71d2fa26e77db8689028ff/screenshots/17/17.3/06-team-payment-owner.a4e6101d.png\" alt=\"The PAYMENT tab on a team page as the Owner, with Request Payment outlined.\"></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>Somebody who does not own the team sees the same tab with only <strong>Pay</strong> on it.\n    <p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/MaabSaleeem/scoryboard@6fde7f174a61b4d44e71d2fa26e77db8689028ff/screenshots/17/17.3/07-team-payment-admin.d398390d.png\" alt=\"The same PAYMENT tab as a team Administrator, showing only the Pay control.\"></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>A match has its own <strong>PAYMENT</strong> panel, and a request raised there belongs to that match.\n    <p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/MaabSaleeem/scoryboard@6fde7f174a61b4d44e71d2fa26e77db8689028ff/screenshots/17/17.3/08-match-payment-panel.d4983a9e.png\" alt=\"The PAYMENT panel on a match page, with Request Payment outlined and one request listed.\"></p>\n  </li>\n</ol>\n\n<h2>If it does not work</h2>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Select Team says \"No teams found where you are the owner\".</strong> Open <strong>Teams</strong> in the sidebar once, then try again. Scoryboard reads your teams when you visit that page.\n    <p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/MaabSaleeem/scoryboard@6fde7f174a61b4d44e71d2fa26e77db8689028ff/screenshots/17/17.3/09-select-team-empty.5a6268f4.png\" alt=\"The Select Team window reading &quot;Your Teams (0)&quot; and &quot;No teams found where you are the owner.&quot;\"></p>\n  </li>\n  <li><strong>There is no Request Payment button.</strong> You do not own that team or leaderboard. Only the Owner can ask for money on it.</li>\n  <li><strong>Choosing Request Payment opens a Stripe window.</strong> Your payout account is not finished. See <a href=\"https://help.scoryboard.com/en/articles/16775810-setting-up-your-payout-account\">Setting up your payout account</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Related</h2>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://help.scoryboard.com/en/articles/16775812-choosing-who-to-charge-and-setting-the-amount-and-due-date\">Choosing who to charge, and setting the amount and due date</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://help.scoryboard.com/en/articles/16775817-tracking-money-you-have-asked-for\">Tracking money you have asked for</a></li>\n</ul>"
}
